# deploy/docker/Dockerfile copies only main.py, preflight.py, VERSION, app/, seeds/ and one model;
# deploy/docker/worker.Dockerfile copies worker/requirements.txt and worker/kh_worker/.
# Everything else stays out of the build context (the venv, builds and local data are gigabytes).
*
!main.py
!preflight.py
!VERSION
!requirements.txt
!app/
!seeds/
!models/bge-small-en-v1.5/
# deploy/docker/worker.Dockerfile (kh-worker): its requirements and package only
!worker/requirements.txt
!worker/kh_worker/
**/__pycache__
